{"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/init()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"}],"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Processing","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNFormatter"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Processing"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Normalization-is-what-makes-a-score-fully-typed","text":"Normalization is what makes a score fully typed","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","type":"reference"},{"text":" promotes only the tags that bind cleanly as written. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalizer performs the repairs that let the rest promote, then re-runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promotion on the result:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a tag-name alias is collapsed to its canonical long form;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a deprecated parameter name is renamed to its current one;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":" reference in tag-parameter position is substituted by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declared value;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a parameter of the wrong type is dropped, since such a value is inert —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\staccato<0.5>"},{"type":"text","text":" means the same as a bare "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\staccato"},{"type":"text","text":";"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"so is one written to a tag that keeps none, one written on an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tag, and a raw (unquoted) identifier, none of which anything reads;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a unit written on a parameter that cannot carry one is dropped, keeping"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magnitude."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each of those is something Guido provably never reads, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"licenses the repair: the score’s meaning is unchanged and the loss is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announced rather than silent. The one thing no repair touches is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"$variable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reference no declaration answers, which has to survive to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each is reported as a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change","type":"reference"},{"text":". Re-running promotion is safe because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promotion is a total, idempotent function of a tag’s name and parameters,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the two untyped lanes as its fallback: a tag that still does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bind is carried through exactly as written.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The visible consequence is that ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a parsed score is less typed than a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"normalized one"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". A consumer that switches over ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","type":"reference"},{"text":" should read a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"score whose ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore\/isNormalized","type":"reference"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"What-it-does-not-do","text":"What it does not do","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Normalization never fails. Three defects survive every repair above — a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"required parameter still missing, an unnamed parameter past the end of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tag’s template, and a value the tag’s own class cannot read — and each is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carried through to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","type":"reference"},{"text":", which reports it as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","type":"reference"},{"text":". Judging is the validator’s job; this stage only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"repairs, so a caller that wants a diagnosis calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" on what it gets back.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tag carrying one of those three stays on an untyped lane, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gives the validator something to read. Otherwise the only untyped tags left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after normalization are the ones that belong there: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose name GMN does not reserve at all, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which is down to the three reserved names no typed payload claims —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\port","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\DrHoos","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\DrRenz","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnnormalizer"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"ro